1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,360
My question for AI companies would be,

2
00:00:02,720 --> 00:00:03,320
what's your mission?

3
00:00:03,760 --> 00:00:05,100
What's your driving force?

4
00:00:05,820 --> 00:00:08,940
I'm wondering if AI will rob my son of

5
00:00:08,940 --> 00:00:12,480
the opportunity to develop his critical thinking skills,

6
00:00:12,780 --> 00:00:13,700
his mental muscle,

7
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:16,880
his ability to analyze and criticize as he goes

8
00:00:16,880 --> 00:00:18,160
through his college education.

9
00:00:18,760 --> 00:00:21,700
Will AI's capabilities lead me to losing my job

10
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:22,360
as a writer?

11
00:00:23,060 --> 00:00:25,780
Can AI be my thought partner in writing instead

12
00:00:25,780 --> 00:00:26,980
of replacing me as a writer?

13
00:00:26,980 --> 00:00:29,980
Can I use AI to help generate ideas,

14
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:31,640
stimulating my thinking in a new way?
